{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike card game where you fuse any two creatures to discover hundreds of secret combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/fad461889612a9d597b41d5ae8bbd82e.poster.avif?t=1772398366\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/fad461889612a9d597b41d5ae8bbd82e.webm?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/fad461889612a9d597b41d5ae8bbd82e.mp4?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUSE ANY TWO CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your greatest weapon is the forbidden art of Soul Fusion. Combine any two Soul cards to forge a new, more powerful being. A noble knight and a demonic beast? A mythical hydra and a clockwork golem? With hundreds of combinations to discover, your knowledge and creativity can turn a losing battle into a victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/95f7582f2c42cd0ac39a8a994fb96043.poster.avif?t=1772398366\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/95f7582f2c42cd0ac39a8a994fb96043.webm?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/95f7582f2c42cd0ac39a8a994fb96043.mp4?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAFT YOUR ARMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run begins with a draft. Choose from a roster of heroes, monsters, and outcasts: each with unique powers that synergize with your strategy and unlock even more powerful fusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/4741e68ba283a39ce91f7a732288b28a.poster.avif?t=1772398366\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/4741e68ba283a39ce91f7a732288b28a.webm?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/4741e68ba283a39ce91f7a732288b28a.mp4?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTSMART YOUR ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful opponents who telegraph their deadliest moves before they strike. Each round is a puzzle: do you go for the win now, or build your defenses to survive the onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/e7a3ce18c4cae6490110d8b32ffd3191.poster.avif?t=1772398366\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/e7a3ce18c4cae6490110d8b32ffd3191.webm?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/e7a3ce18c4cae6490110d8b32ffd3191.mp4?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR OWN PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. Navigate branching paths through procedurally generated encounters. Choose between combat trials, rewards, and escalating threats on your way out of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRING A FRIEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up in co-op. Each player has their own deck, but they share one life pool and one battlefield. Protect each other, set up devastating combos, and fight as a single, vengeful force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse any two creatures to discover hundreds of secret combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of creatures to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft a unique deck every run from a massive roster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical boss encounters with telegraphed moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike structure with procedurally generated runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legend doesn't end in the abyss. It begins there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather your allies, command the damned, and claim your vengeance.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058050?t=1772398366","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/c1f8c0f10a118e87b5d78612757f8227f0b653d7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772398366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/6079c1da78ca599576e4987dab1c2d251ac333aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772398366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/6079c1da78ca599576e4987dab1c2d251ac333aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772398366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike card game where you fuse any two creatures to discover hundreds of secret combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/fad461889612a9d597b41d5ae8bbd82e.poster.avif?t=1772398366\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/fad461889612a9d597b41d5ae8bbd82e.webm?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/fad461889612a9d597b41d5ae8bbd82e.mp4?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUSE ANY TWO CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your greatest weapon is the forbidden art of Soul Fusion. Combine any two Soul cards to forge a new, more powerful being. A noble knight and a demonic beast? A mythical hydra and a clockwork golem? With hundreds of combinations to discover, your knowledge and creativity can turn a losing battle into a victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/95f7582f2c42cd0ac39a8a994fb96043.poster.avif?t=1772398366\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/95f7582f2c42cd0ac39a8a994fb96043.webm?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/95f7582f2c42cd0ac39a8a994fb96043.mp4?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAFT YOUR ARMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run begins with a draft. Choose from a roster of heroes, monsters, and outcasts: each with unique powers that synergize with your strategy and unlock even more powerful fusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/4741e68ba283a39ce91f7a732288b28a.poster.avif?t=1772398366\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/4741e68ba283a39ce91f7a732288b28a.webm?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/4741e68ba283a39ce91f7a732288b28a.mp4?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTSMART YOUR ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful opponents who telegraph their deadliest moves before they strike. Each round is a puzzle: do you go for the win now, or build your defenses to survive the onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/e7a3ce18c4cae6490110d8b32ffd3191.poster.avif?t=1772398366\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/e7a3ce18c4cae6490110d8b32ffd3191.webm?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/extras/e7a3ce18c4cae6490110d8b32ffd3191.mp4?t=1772398366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR OWN PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. Navigate branching paths through procedurally generated encounters. Choose between combat trials, rewards, and escalating threats on your way out of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRING A FRIEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up in co-op. Each player has their own deck, but they share one life pool and one battlefield. Protect each other, set up devastating combos, and fight as a single, vengeful force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse any two creatures to discover hundreds of secret combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of creatures to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft a unique deck every run from a massive roster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical boss encounters with telegraphed moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike structure with procedurally generated runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legend doesn't end in the abyss. It begins there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather your allies, command the damned, and claim your vengeance.</strong></p>","developers":["thenameisflic"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058050/1e58fb9a4f504cd05a62220c